OL,4,CHuw Edwards gives first interviews     
OL,5,Csince child abuse image conviction     
OL,6,GDisgraced former BBC News presenter    
OL,7,GHuw Edwards has given his first        
OL,8,Ginterviews since being convicted in    
OL,9,G2024 for making indecent images of     
OL,10,Gchildren.                              
OL,12,FEdwards is seen saying he believes     
OL,13,F"silence is toxic" in a clip of a      
OL,14,Fpodcast released by the Observer       
OL,15,Fnewspaper, and he has also been        
OL,16,Finterviewed for a Channel 4            
OL,17,Fdocumentary.                           
