OL,4,CWoman whose 'real-life ghost story'    
OL,5,Cinspired TV series reveals scariest    
OL,6,Cencounter                              
OL,7,GThe woman at the centre of a "real-    
OL,8,Glife ghost story" that inspired a new  
OL,9,GTV drama says the scariest thing she   
OL,10,Gsaw was an "old lady" looking at her   
OL,11,Gfrom her house.                        
OL,13,FLiz Rich moved from London to Bannau   
OL,14,FBrycheiniog, also known as Brecon      
OL,15,FBeacons, with her husband while        
OL,16,Fpregnant in 1989 to a farmhouse now    
OL,17,Fdubbed one of Britain's most haunted   
OL,18,Fhouses.                                
