OL,4,CMinisters hiding behind data           
OL,5,Cprotection on Sir Galahad bombing      
OL,6,Cfiles, says veteran                    
OL,7,GA Falklands War veteran who was left   
OL,8,Gseverely burned in an attack on his    
OL,9,Gship has accused ministers of hiding   
OL,10,Gbehind data protection in refusing to  
OL,11,Grelease all files on the bombing.      
OL,13,FThe undefended supply ship Sir Galahad 
OL,14,Fwas hit by Argentinian planes in June  
OL,15,F1982m killing 48 people, including 32  
OL,16,FWelsh Guards.                          
OL,18,FThe Welsh Guards had previously been   
OL,19,Fblamed for not leaving the ship        
OL,20,Fearlier, but files released later      
OL,21,Fcleared them of any blame.             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
